docs/MASTER_SPEC.md is the single source of truth. Never invent a business rule.
If something is not specified, or two rules conflict, stop and list it as a question
for Boobalan in docs/QUESTIONS.md.

- Build in the phase order of Section 14; run that phase's acceptance tests before moving on.
- Before writing code for a phase, write a short plan (files, collections, endpoints, tests) and wait for confirmation.
- All money/salary/incentive/score calculations run only on the server. Money is integer paise.
- TypeScript strict, zod validation on every API input, no `any`.
- Times stored as UTC; business-day logic in Asia/Kolkata (`dateIST`).
